    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s not about \"healing.\" it's just painful. watching it all break is just... it's exhausting. part of me feels like it would be Kinder to just not be there for the end. to just slip away before it's all gone and ugly. don't you think there's a certain dignity in leaving on your own terms before the decay is total?",
